{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-04-24 12:15:00', 'title': 'LINDE DECLARES DIVIDEND IN SECOND QUARTER 2023', 'text': 'WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 24, 2023 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN) ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.275 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 16, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 2, 2023.'}